BT /F1 18 Tf 0 g 54 750 Td (Threads Portfolio App Summary) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 0 g 54 720 Td (WHAT IT IS) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0 g 54 706 Td (A single-page portfolio web app for Rian Touag, built with Next.js App Router and TypeScript.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0 g 54 692 Td (It presents project work, designer profile details, and social links with animation-heavy UI interactions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 0 g 54 672 Td (WHO IT'S FOR) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0 g 54 658 Td (Primary persona: recruiters, hiring managers, founders, and collaborators evaluating a senior product designer.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 0 g 54 638 Td (WHAT IT DOES) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0 g 62 624 Td (\225 Displays an animated intro with profile info, last-updated date, and social links.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0 g 62 610 Td (\225 Renders portfolio work groups from structured data in `lib/work-groups.ts`.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0 g 62 596 Td (\225 Provides draggable project image carousels with responsive sizing and gesture handling.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0 g 62 582 Td (\225 Opens desktop image lightboxes with keyboard navigation and preloading.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0 g 62 568 Td (\225 Supports theme selection via `next-themes` with system preference initialization.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0 g 62 554 Td (\225 Generates SEO metadata, structured data, sitemap output, robots file, and web manifest.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0 g 62 540 Td (\225 Tracks interactions using a visitors script \(`cdn.visitors.now`\) and typed `window.visitors` events.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 0 g 54 520 Td (HOW IT WORKS \(REPO-EVIDENCED ARCHITECTURE\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0 g 62 506 Td (\225 UI layer: Next.js App Router \(`app/layout.tsx`, `app/page.tsx`\) composes intro + work sections.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0 g 62 492 Td (\225 Component layer: `components/` manages smooth scroll \(Lenis\), carousels, lightbox, and theme wrappers.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0 g 62 478 Td (\225 Data/config layer: `lib/work-groups.ts`, `lib/site-config.ts`, constants, hooks, and image utilities.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0 g 62 464 Td (\225 Build-time scripts: `scripts/generate-blur-placeholders.js` and `scripts/get-last-commit-date.js` produce JSON used at runtime.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0 g 62 450 Td (\225 Static assets: project images/logos/icons/profile files under `public/` consumed via Next/Image or @unpic/react.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0 g 62 436 Td (\225 External services: visitors analytics script loaded in layout; no internal API routes found.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0 g 62 422 Td (\225 Persistent database or backend service: Not found in repo.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 0 g 54 402 Td (HOW TO RUN \(MINIMAL\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0 g 62 388 Td (1. Install dependencies: `npm install`) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0 g 62 374 Td (2. Start dev server: `npm run dev`) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0 g 62 360 Td (3. Open `http://localhost:3000` in a browser.) Tj ET
